<title>UK: Kexim sets $500 mln five-year bond, +42-44 b.p.</title>
<headline>Kexim sets $500 mln five-year bond, +42-44 b.p.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Nomura International and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EXPORT-IMPORT BANK OF KOREA</p>
<p> AMT	  $500 MLN  COUPON     **	  MATURITY    20.SEP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    20.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+42-44 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED TUESDAY.</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 5-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/KR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  KOREA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.50 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 31.AUG.01 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
